/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2442029029","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98600#issuecomment-2442029029","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98600","id":2442029029,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Rjmfl","user":{"login":"PeterMarques","id":32851924,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyODUxOTI0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32851924?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PeterMarques","html_url":"https://github.com/PeterMarques","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PeterMarques/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PeterMarques/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PeterMarques/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PeterMarques/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PeterMarques/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PeterMarques/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PeterMarques/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PeterMarques/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PeterMarques/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-28T16:14:06Z","updated_at":"2024-10-28T16:14:06Z","body":"OH!\r\n\r\nin 3.x it is a void func:\r\n● void create(width: int, height: int, use_mipmaps: bool, format: Format)\r\n\r\nbut in 4.x it returns a image:\r\n● Image create(width: int, height: int, use_mipmaps: bool, format: Format) static\r\n\r\nShould pay more atentention to debugging, indeed.. Thanks.\r\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2442029029/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]